        "Description": "Turns out this runs far deeper than we ever thought. Our intel says Ted Mendez,  is planning on holding Siera knox hostage on the track as leverage against Robert Knox for his robitics technology.  Several staff and even knox&apos;s own men have been paid off by the government to hide whats going on, ready to wipe anything that might incriminate Mendez.\r\rWe&apos;re on a time crunch 47, its only amatter of time until Mendez loses his patience\r\rGood luck\r\rAlternate timeline kinda deal GLHF",
